Title: Presentation of 27th to 30th Reports of the Standing Committee on Rural Development on Demands for Grants (2007-2008) of various Departments. 

SHRI V. KISHORE CHANDRA S. DEO (PARVATIPURAM): I beg to presenta copy each of the following Reports (Hindi and English versions) of the Standing Committee on Rural Development:

(1) Twenty-Seventh Report on Demands for Grants (2007-2008) of the Department of Land Resources (Ministry of Rural Development);

(2) Twenty-Eighth Report on Demands for Grants (2007-2008) of the Department of Drinking Water Supply (Ministry of Rural Development);

(3) Twenty-Ninth Report on Demands for Grants (2007-2008) of the Department of Rural Development (Ministry of Rural Development); and 

(4) Thirtieth Report on Demands for Grants (2007-2008) of the Ministry of Panchayati Raj.
